---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="页面不存在" noindex>
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center py-20 md:py-28 gap-4">
    <p class="text-accent text-6xl md:text-7xl font-semibold leading-none">404</p>
    <h1 class="text-2xl text-heading1 font-semibold mt-2">这个页面不存在</h1>
    <p class="text-base/7 text-foreground">链接可能写错了，或者页面已经被移走。</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center mt-4">
      <a class="button !px-5" href="/">返回首页</a>
      <a class="button !px-5" href="/notes/">Java 面试笔记</a>
      <a class="button !px-5" href="/plan/">减脂计划</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
